  "reasoning": "The facts describe a scheme in which the defendants, acting as village cadres, falsified information and used public land compensation to obtain pension insurance benefits for themselves and relatives, and collected cash under the pretense of processing fees. This constitutes fraud (诈骗) because they deceived the social security authority to obtain benefits. Additionally, as village officials who abused their positions to appropriate public land resources for personal gain, their conduct fits the crime of embezzlement of public assets by a person in a position of authority (职务侵占). Both offenses are distinct and should be listed.",
